<title>FINLAND: TAMFELT PROPOSES HIGHER 1996 DIVIDENDS.</title>
<headline>TAMFELT PROPOSES HIGHER 1996 DIVIDENDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Proposed dividend, preferred shr(markka)  5.80 vs 3.40</p>
<p>Proposed dividend, ordinary shr (markka)  5.60 vs 3.20</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	     99 vs 76</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    75.4 vs 65.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish paper industry equipment maker</p>
<p>is Tamfelt Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
